# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn how to use and build IBM Quantum Function templates."
msgstr "Pelajari cara menggunakan dan membangun template IBM Quantum Function."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to IBM Quantum Function templates"
msgstr "Pengantar template IBM Quantum Function"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to IBM Quantum Function templates {#introduction-to-ibm-quantum-function-templates}"
msgstr "Pengantar template IBM Quantum Function {#introduction-to-ibm-quantum-function-templates}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Quantum Function templates](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) are an open-source collection of realistic code examples that give you access to some of the latest research workflows that leverage tools like the Qiskit SDK and [Qiskit addons](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/addons). These pre-built workflows take information from practical experiments and package them in a way that you can customize and reuse in your own research so that you don't have to build from scratch. All templates are readily deployable as [managed workflows](/guides/managed-workflows), where you can easily leverage classical compute as part of your workflow.\n"
msgstr "[Template fungsi kuantum](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) adalah kumpulan contoh kode realistis yang bersifat open-source, yang memberi kamu akses ke beberapa workflow riset terbaru yang memanfaatkan alat seperti Qiskit SDK dan [Qiskit addons](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/addons). Workflow yang sudah dibangun sebelumnya ini mengambil informasi dari eksperimen praktis dan mengemasnya dengan cara yang bisa kamu kustomisasi dan gunakan kembali dalam riset sendiri, sehingga kamu tidak perlu membangun dari nol. Semua template siap digunakan sebagai [managed workflows](/guides/managed-workflows), tempat kamu bisa dengan mudah memanfaatkan komputasi klasik sebagai bagian dari workflow-mu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two types of templates:\n"
msgstr "Ada dua jenis template:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Template implementations*: Specialized code examples that implement advanced techniques from real-world experiments in areas like chemistry and physics.\n"
msgstr "*Implementasi template*: Contoh kode khusus yang mengimplementasikan teknik-teknik canggih dari eksperimen dunia nyata di bidang seperti kimia dan fisika.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Base templates*: References for developing your own original quantum function. These templates highlight best-practices in interface development, code formatting, unit testing, and more.\n"
msgstr "*Template dasar*: Referensi untuk mengembangkan fungsi kuantum orisinalmu sendiri. Template ini menonjolkan praktik terbaik dalam pengembangan antarmuka, pemformatan kode, pengujian unit, dan lainnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Template implementations {#template-implementations}"
msgstr "Implementasi template {#template-implementations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum Function template implementations are organized by application area. Currently included in the collection are two physics templates that use the [AQC-Tensor Qiskit addon](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-aqc-tensor) (one for Hamiltonian simulation and one for AQC + Trotter Hamiltonian dynamics) and a chemistry template for electronic structure with the implicit solvent model using the [SQD Qiskit addon](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd).\n"
"Resources to get started with these templates are available at the following links:\n"
msgstr ""
"Implementasi template fungsi kuantum diorganisir berdasarkan area aplikasi. Saat ini yang termasuk dalam koleksi adalah dua template fisika yang menggunakan [Qiskit addon AQC-Tensor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-aqc-tensor) (satu untuk simulasi Hamiltonian dan satu untuk dinamika Hamiltonian AQC + Trotter) dan template kimia untuk struktur elektronik dengan model pelarut implisit menggunakan [Qiskit addon SQD](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd).\n"
"Sumber daya untuk memulai dengan template-template ini tersedia di tautan berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Electronic structure simulation with implicit solvent model: [template source files](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/chemistry/sqd_pcm) and [guide](/guides/function-template-chemistry-workflow)\n"
msgstr "Simulasi struktur elektronik dengan model pelarut implisit: [file sumber template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/chemistry/sqd_pcm) dan [panduan](/guides/function-template-chemistry-workflow)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hamiltonian simulation: [template source files](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/hamiltonian_simulation) and [guide](/guides/function-template-hamiltonian-simulation)\n"
msgstr "Simulasi Hamiltonian: [file sumber template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/hamiltonian_simulation) dan [panduan](/guides/function-template-hamiltonian-simulation)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "AQC + Trotter Hamiltonian dynamics: [template source files](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/aqc_trotter) and [guide](/guides/function-template-aqc-trotter)\n"
msgstr "Dinamika Hamiltonian AQC + Trotter: [file sumber template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/aqc_trotter) dan [panduan](/guides/function-template-aqc-trotter)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Base templates {#base-templates}"
msgstr "Template dasar {#base-templates}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The *base templates* are references for developing your own original quantum function. They are designed to help you kickstart the development process by illustrating best practices in interface development, code formatting, I/O handling, error messages, checkpoints, unit testing, and more. The repository is exposed as a [GitHub template](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/creating-and-managing-repositories/creating-a-template-repository) so that the CI/CD implementation can be easily extended.\n"
msgstr "*Template dasar* adalah referensi untuk mengembangkan fungsi kuantum orisinalmu sendiri. Template ini dirancang untuk membantumu memulai proses pengembangan dengan mengilustrasikan praktik terbaik dalam pengembangan antarmuka, pemformatan kode, penanganan I/O, pesan error, checkpoint, pengujian unit, dan lainnya. Repositori ini diekspos sebagai [template GitHub](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/creating-and-managing-repositories/creating-a-template-repository) sehingga implementasi CI/CD bisa diperluas dengan mudah.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are currently two templates: a [circuit function template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/blob/main/base_templates/circuit_function_template.py) and an [application function template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/blob/main/base_templates/application_function_template.py).\n"
msgstr "Saat ini ada dua template: [template circuit function](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/blob/main/base_templates/circuit_function_template.py) dan [template application function](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/blob/main/base_templates/application_function_template.py).\n"

